      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <span>🔗</span> Upstream &amp; Downstream Quantitative Studios
      </h3>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
        <a href="/stoichiometry" style="display: block; padding: 1rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #e11d48; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Stoichiometry &amp; Reaction Yield &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.4;">
