        <a href="/molarity" style="display: block; padding: 1rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #059669; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Solution Molarity Studio &rarr;</div>
